<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Luscious Lawless"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="甘美な無法"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="甜蜜的无理取闹"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="RIM"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="理芽"/><amll:meta key="album" value="NEW ROMANCER"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPZ922015563"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1867928235"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0002KHKK2L9XVm"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="406403507"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="4m8tvcDYyaZgUhvqtHRocK"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1688521739"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:41.360"><div begin="14.840" end="3:41.360"><p begin="14.840" end="18.220" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.840" end="15.310">３</span><span begin="15.310" end="15.580">＋</span><span begin="15.580" end="16.130">１</span><span begin="16.130" end="16.340">は</span><span begin="16.500" end="16.820">４</span><span begin="16.940" end="17.180">で</span><span begin="17.180" end="17.400">は</span><span begin="17.400" end="17.590">な</span><span begin="17.590" end="17.820">い</span><span begin="17.820" end="17.950">ん</span><span begin="17.950" end="18.120">で</span><span begin="18.120" end="18.220">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">三加一并不等于四</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">三加一併不等於四</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Three plus one does not equal four</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">3＋1은 4가 아닌 거예요</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Trois plus un ne font pas quatre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tres más uno no son cuatro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Drei plus eins ist nicht vier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Três mais um não é quatro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Три плюс один вовсе не четыре</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tre più uno non fa quattro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">San purasu ichi wa yon dewa naindesu</span></p><p begin="18.290" end="21.870" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.290" end="18.510">あ</span><span begin="18.510" end="18.720">い</span><span begin="18.720" end="18.830">つ</span><span begin="18.920" end="19.160">が</span><span begin="19.160" end="19.580">笑</span><span begin="19.580" end="19.720">え</span><span begin="19.720" end="19.860">ば</span><span begin="20.050" end="20.350">夢</span><span begin="20.570" end="20.990">際</span><span begin="20.990" end="21.160">の</span><span begin="21.160" end="21.510">サ</span><span begin="21.510" end="21.670">イ</span><span begin="21.670" end="21.870">レン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那家伙一笑 便是梦境边缘的警笛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那傢伙一笑 便是夢境邊緣的警笛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When that one laughs a siren sounds at the edge of dreams</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 녀석이 웃으면 꿈결 끝자락의 사이렌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand cette personne rit c’est une sirène au bord du rêve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si se ríe suena una sirena al borde del sueño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn dieser Mensch lacht heulen Sirenen am Rand der Träume</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando aquela pessoa sorri soa a sirene à beira dos sonhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Стоит ему рассмеяться и у края сна воет сирена</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se quello ride è una sirena sul confine dei sogni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aitsu ga waraeba yumegiwa no sairen</span></p><p begin="22.050" end="25.320" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.050" end="22.800">面</span><span begin="22.800" end="23.000">上</span><span begin="23.000" end="23.340">げ</span><span begin="23.340" end="23.480">て</span><span begin="23.480" end="23.510">、</span><span begin="23.690" end="23.920">両</span><span begin="24.130" end="24.370">眼</span><span begin="24.370" end="24.580">を</span><span begin="24.580" end="25.040">開</span><span begin="25.040" end="25.150">い</span><span begin="25.150" end="25.320">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抬起头，睁开双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">抬起頭，睜開雙眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lift your head open both your eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고개를 들고 두 눈을 떠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Relève la tête ouvre grand les deux yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Alza el rostro abre bien los ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Heb den Kopf und öffne beide Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Erga o rosto abra bem os olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Подними голову открой оба глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Alza il viso e apri entrambi gli occhi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omote agete, ryoume o hiraite</span></p><p begin="25.500" end="29.200" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.500" end="25.860">海</span><span begin="26.140" end="26.390">の</span><span begin="26.390" end="26.550">向</span><span begin="26.550" end="26.860">こ</span><span begin="26.860" end="26.960">う</span><span begin="26.960" end="27.120">へ</span><span begin="27.120" end="27.150">、</span><span begin="27.300" end="27.570">空</span><span begin="27.720" end="28.210">中</span><span begin="28.210" end="28.400">の</span><span begin="28.400" end="28.830">遊</span><span begin="28.830" end="29.200">泳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着海的彼端，空中游弋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">向著海的彼端，空中游弋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Beyond the sea swimming through the air</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">바다 너머로 허공을 헤엄쳐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Vers l’autre côté de la mer nageant dans les airs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hacia el otro lado del mar nadando por el aire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hinüber ans andere Ende des Meeres im freien Flug durch die Luft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para além do mar nadando pelo ar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">За море вперёд в плавание по воздуху</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oltre il mare nuotando nell’aria</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Umi no mukou e, kuuchuu no yuuei</span></p><p begin="29.310" end="30.710" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.310" end="29.810">神</span><span begin="29.810" end="29.970">を</span><span begin="29.970" end="30.220">知</span><span begin="30.220" end="30.430">る</span><span begin="30.430" end="30.560">果</span><span begin="30.560" end="30.710">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">识得神明的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">識得神明的盡頭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To the farthest edge of knowing God</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">신을 알게 되는 끝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au bout de la connaissance de Dieu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hasta el confín donde se conoce a Dios</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bis ans Ende wo man Gott erkennt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No fim onde se conhece Deus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Туда где познают Бога до самого конца</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Alla fine dove si conosce Dio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kami o shiru hate</span></p><p begin="30.920" end="33.000" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.920" end="31.360">甘</span><span begin="31.360" end="31.580">美</span><span begin="31.580" end="31.830">な</span><span begin="31.830" end="32.020">無</span><span begin="32.020" end="32.280">法</span><span begin="32.280" end="32.390">地</span><span begin="32.390" end="32.770">帯</span><span begin="32.770" end="33.000">へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前往甘美无法的地带</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">前往甘美無法的地帶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Into the luscious lawless zone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">감미로운 무법지대로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Vers cette délicieuse zone de non-droit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hacia una dulce zona sin ley</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hin zu einem süßen gesetzlosen Ort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Rumo a uma doce terra sem lei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В сладостную зону беззакония</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Verso una dolce terra senza legge</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanbi na muhou chitai e</span></p><p begin="34.510" end="36.310" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.510" end="35.000">赤</span><span begin="35.000" end="35.150">い</span><span begin="35.150" end="35.340">自</span><span begin="35.340" end="35.540">慰</span><span begin="35.630" end="36.120">行</span><span begin="36.120" end="36.310">為</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赤红的自慰行径</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">赤紅的自慰行徑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Crimson self-pleasure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">붉은 자위 행위</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un acte solitaire écarlate</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una masturbación roja</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Rote Selbstbefriedigung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma masturbação tingida de vermelho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Алая мастурбация</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un atto di piacere rosso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Akai jiikoui</span></p><p begin="36.520" end="37.910" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.520" end="37.040">春</span><span begin="37.040" end="37.210">へ</span><span begin="37.210" end="37.370">手</span><span begin="37.490" end="37.660">向</span><span begin="37.660" end="37.760">け</span><span begin="37.760" end="37.910">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">献予春日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">獻予春日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Offered up to spring</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">봄에 바쳤어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Offert au printemps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ofrecida a la primavera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dem Frühling dargebracht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Oferecida à primavera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Принесённая в дар весне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Offerto in dono alla primavera</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Haru e tamuketa</span></p><p begin="38.120" end="40.310" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.120" end="38.370">対</span><span begin="38.550" end="38.760">無</span><span begin="38.760" end="38.980">象</span><span begin="38.980" end="39.230">ス</span><span begin="39.230" end="39.470">トー</span><span begin="39.470" end="39.590">リー</span><span begin="39.590" end="39.740">ラ</span><span begin="39.740" end="39.830">イ</span><span begin="39.920" end="40.310">ター</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对抗虚无的故事写手</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">對抗虛無的故事寫手</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A story writer against the void</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">대무상 스토리라이터</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Faiseuse d’histoires contre le néant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Escritora de historias contra la nada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Storywriter gegen das Nichts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Roteirista contra aquilo que não tem forma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сценарист историй против небытия</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Uno story writer contro il nulla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taimuzou sutooriiraitaa</span></p><p begin="41.510" end="47.380" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.510" end="42.420">厭</span><span begin="42.420" end="42.540">わ</span><span begin="42.650" end="42.950">な</span><span begin="42.950" end="43.080">い</span><span begin="43.080" end="43.540">で</span><span begin="43.540" end="47.380">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别厌恶啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請別厭惡啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t turn away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">싫어하지 말아 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne me déteste pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No me rechaces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verabscheu mich nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não rejeite isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не отвергай меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non disdegnarmi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itowanaide yo</span></p><p begin="48.710" end="54.610" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.710" end="49.650">厭</span><span begin="49.650" end="49.860">わ</span><span begin="49.860" end="50.220">な</span><span begin="50.220" end="50.320">い</span><span begin="50.320" end="50.760">で</span><span begin="50.760" end="54.610">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别厌恶啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請別厭惡啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t turn away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">싫어하지 말아 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne me déteste pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No me rechaces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verabscheu mich nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não rejeite isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не отвергай меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non disdegnarmi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itowanaide yo</span></p><p begin="57.760" end="1:00.840" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.760" end="58.420">嘘</span><span begin="58.420" end="58.520">つ</span><span begin="58.520" end="58.900">き</span><span begin="58.900" end="59.320">な</span><span begin="59.320" end="59.540">あ</span><span begin="59.540" end="59.770">な</span><span begin="59.770" end="59.980">た</span><span begin="59.980" end="1:00.230">た</span><span begin="1:00.230" end="1:00.360">ち</span><span begin="1:00.360" end="1:00.840">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给满口谎言的你们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">給滿口謊言的你們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To all you liars</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거짓말쟁이인 너희에게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À vous qui ne savez que mentir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A ustedes que viven de mentiras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Euch Lügnern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A vocês que vivem de mentiras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вам лжецам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">A voi che siete bugiardi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Usotsuki na anatatachi ni</span></p><p begin="1:01.360" end="1:04.490" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.360" end="1:01.810">名</span><span begin="1:01.810" end="1:02.530">前</span><span begin="1:02.530" end="1:02.940">を</span><span begin="1:02.940" end="1:03.190">つ</span><span begin="1:03.190" end="1:03.420">け</span><span begin="1:03.420" end="1:03.640">て</span><span begin="1:03.640" end="1:03.880">あ</span><span begin="1:03.880" end="1:04.010">げ</span><span begin="1:04.010" end="1:04.490">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">起上一个名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">起上一個名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;ll give each of you a name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이름을 붙여 줄게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vais donner un nom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Les pondré un nombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich Namen geben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou dar um nome</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я дам имена</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Darò io un nome</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Namae o tsukete ageru</span></p><p begin="1:04.960" end="1:08.000" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.960" end="1:05.410">日</span><span begin="1:05.410" end="1:05.700">が</span><span begin="1:05.700" end="1:05.800">暮</span><span begin="1:05.800" end="1:06.170">れ</span><span begin="1:06.170" end="1:06.550">る</span><span begin="1:06.550" end="1:06.780">ま</span><span begin="1:06.780" end="1:06.940">で</span><span begin="1:06.940" end="1:07.440">遊</span><span begin="1:07.440" end="1:07.560">ん</span><span begin="1:07.560" end="1:08.000">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嬉戏直至日暮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">嬉戲直至日暮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Play until the sun goes down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">해가 질 때까지 놀다가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Jouons jusqu’à la tombée du jour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Juguemos hasta que caiga el sol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Spielt mit mir bis die Sonne untergeht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos brincar até o sol se pôr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Будем играть пока не стемнеет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Giochiamo finché non cala il sole</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hi ga kureru made asonde</span></p><p begin="1:08.570" end="1:11.640" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.570" end="1:09.370">話</span><span begin="1:09.370" end="1:09.710">を</span><span begin="1:09.710" end="1:10.180">今</span><span begin="1:10.180" end="1:10.420">度</span><span begin="1:10.420" end="1:10.620">は</span><span begin="1:10.620" end="1:10.860">聞</span><span begin="1:10.860" end="1:11.060">か</span><span begin="1:11.060" end="1:11.190">せ</span><span begin="1:11.190" end="1:11.640">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这次换你讲故事给我听</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這次換你講故事給我聽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This time let me hear your story</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이번에는 이야기를 들려줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette fois raconte-moi ton histoire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta vez cuéntame tú la historia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und diesmal erzähl mir deine Geschichte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desta vez deixe-me ouvir a sua história</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А в следующий раз расскажи мне свою историю</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La prossima volta raccontami la tua storia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hanashi o kondo wa kikasete</span></p><p begin="1:12.150" end="1:15.310" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.150" end="1:12.450">間</span><span begin="1:12.450" end="1:12.840">違</span><span begin="1:12.840" end="1:12.960">い</span><span begin="1:12.960" end="1:13.160">だ</span><span begin="1:13.340" end="1:13.750">ら</span><span begin="1:13.750" end="1:14.000">け</span><span begin="1:14.000" end="1:14.210">の</span><span begin="1:14.210" end="1:14.670">僕</span><span begin="1:14.670" end="1:14.780">ら</span><span begin="1:14.780" end="1:15.310">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给错漏百出的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">給錯漏百出的我們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To us who get everything wrong</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">온통 틀린 것투성이인 우리에게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour nous qui ne faisons que nous tromper</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A nosotros llenos de errores</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir die voller Fehler sind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para nós tão cheios de erros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нам таким полным ошибок</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per noi pieni di errori</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Machigai darake no bokura ni</span></p><p begin="1:15.780" end="1:18.920" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.780" end="1:16.020">も</span><span begin="1:16.020" end="1:16.220">う</span><span begin="1:16.220" end="1:16.560">半</span><span begin="1:16.560" end="1:16.900">信</span><span begin="1:16.900" end="1:17.350">半</span><span begin="1:17.350" end="1:17.570">疑</span><span begin="1:17.570" end="1:17.780">は</span><span begin="1:17.780" end="1:18.030">い</span><span begin="1:18.030" end="1:18.260">ら</span><span begin="1:18.260" end="1:18.410">な</span><span begin="1:18.410" end="1:18.920">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再需要半信半疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不再需要半信半疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">No more wavering between belief and doubt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이젠 반신반의 따윈 필요 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Plus besoin de douter à moitié</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no nos hace falta seguir dudando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Brauchen dieses ewige Zweifeln nicht mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Já não precisamos de meias certezas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Больше не нужны сомнения</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non serve più essere in dubbio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mou hanshinhangi wa iranai</span></p><p begin="1:19.330" end="1:21.410" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.330" end="1:19.610">そ</span><span begin="1:19.610" end="1:19.730">う</span><span begin="1:19.820" end="1:20.100">勘</span><span begin="1:20.100" end="1:20.380">違</span><span begin="1:20.380" end="1:20.440">い</span><span begin="1:20.440" end="1:20.550">し</span><span begin="1:20.550" end="1:20.910">た</span><span begin="1:20.910" end="1:20.980">い</span><span begin="1:20.980" end="1:21.170">の</span><span begin="1:21.170" end="1:21.410">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我便是想这般误解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我便是想這般誤解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That&apos;s what I want to fool myself into believing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래 그렇게 착각하고 싶은 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oui j’ai envie de me tromper ainsi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sí quiero engañarme creyendo eso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ja genau so will ich mich irren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É isso que eu quero acreditar por engano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Да я хочу продолжать так заблуждаться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sì voglio illudermi proprio così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sou kanchigai shitai no sa</span></p><p begin="1:21.410" end="1:23.340" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.410" end="1:21.810">痛</span><span begin="1:21.810" end="1:21.900">い</span><span begin="1:21.900" end="1:22.030">の</span><span begin="1:22.030" end="1:22.540">に</span><span begin="1:22.990" end="1:23.340">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕伴随痛楚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕伴隨痛楚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even though it hurts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아픈데도 말이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si ça fait mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque duela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Obwohl es wehtut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que doa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хоть это и больно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se fa male</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itai noni to</span></p><p begin="1:23.440" end="1:26.530" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.440" end="1:23.780">単</span><span begin="1:23.780" end="1:24.050">身</span><span begin="1:24.130" end="1:24.570">装</span><span begin="1:24.570" end="1:24.770">備</span><span begin="1:24.770" end="1:24.820">じ</span><span begin="1:24.820" end="1:25.050">ゃ</span><span begin="1:25.050" end="1:25.270">足</span><span begin="1:25.270" end="1:25.490">り</span><span begin="1:25.490" end="1:25.660">な</span><span begin="1:25.660" end="1:26.530">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">单枪匹马装备不足</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">單槍匹馬裝備不足</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Going in alone isn&apos;t enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">혼자만의 장비로는 부족해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un équipement en solitaire ne suffit pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ir sola con este equipo no basta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Allein ausgerüstet reicht es nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Estar equipada sozinha não basta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одной экипировки недостаточно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un equipaggiamento da solista non basta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tanshin soubi ja tarinai</span></p><p begin="1:27.040" end="1:28.530" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.040" end="1:27.410">愛</span><span begin="1:27.410" end="1:27.680">は</span><span begin="1:27.680" end="1:27.940">非</span><span begin="1:27.940" end="1:28.280">常</span><span begin="1:28.280" end="1:28.530">勤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱是非常勤的职员</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">愛是非常勤的職員</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Love is only part-time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑은 비상근</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L’amour n’est là qu’à temps partiel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El amor trabaja a media jornada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Liebe arbeitet nur in Teilzeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O amor trabalha só meio período</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Любовь работает по совместительству</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L’amore lavora solo part time</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ai wa hijoukin</span></p><p begin="1:28.580" end="1:30.380" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.580" end="1:28.860">そ</span><span begin="1:28.860" end="1:29.080">れ</span><span begin="1:29.080" end="1:29.220">す</span><span begin="1:29.220" end="1:29.520">ら</span><span begin="1:29.520" end="1:29.900">愛</span><span begin="1:29.900" end="1:30.050">お</span><span begin="1:30.050" end="1:30.240">し</span><span begin="1:30.240" end="1:30.380">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连这也令人怜惜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連這也令人憐惜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even that is dear to me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그것마저 사랑스러워</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et même cela m’est précieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y hasta eso me resulta entrañable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und selbst das ist mir lieb</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E até isso me é precioso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И даже это мне дорого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E perfino questo mi è caro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore sura itooshii</span></p><p begin="1:30.430" end="1:33.770" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.430" end="1:30.880">今</span><span begin="1:30.880" end="1:31.310">更</span><span begin="1:31.310" end="1:31.770">迎</span><span begin="1:31.770" end="1:31.950">え</span><span begin="1:31.950" end="1:32.230">に</span><span begin="1:32.230" end="1:32.470">行</span><span begin="1:32.470" end="1:32.720">く</span><span begin="1:32.810" end="1:33.160">か</span><span begin="1:33.160" end="1:33.400">ら</span><span begin="1:33.400" end="1:33.770">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今才去迎接你呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">事到如今才去迎接你呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;ll come for you now even if it&apos;s late</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이제 와서라도 데리러 갈 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il est bien tard mais je viens te chercher</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque sea tarde iré a buscarte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt komme ich dich doch noch holen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo agora vou buscar você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Теперь уже поздно но я всё равно приду за тобой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ormai verrò a prenderti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Imasara mukae ni yuku kara ne</span></p><p begin="1:34.260" end="1:35.780" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.260" end="1:34.610">後</span><span begin="1:34.610" end="1:34.900">悔</span><span begin="1:34.900" end="1:34.930">を</span><span begin="1:34.930" end="1:35.040">疑</span><span begin="1:35.160" end="1:35.490">問</span><span begin="1:35.490" end="1:35.780">視</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对后悔表示质疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">對後悔表示質疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Questioning regret</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">후회를 의심하고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mettre le regret en doute</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pongo en duda el arrepentimiento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich stelle die Reue infrage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ponho o arrependimento em dúvida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сомневаюсь даже в сожалениях</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Metto in dubbio il rimpianto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Koukai o gimonshi</span></p><p begin="1:35.840" end="1:37.510" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.840" end="1:36.080">胡</span><span begin="1:36.080" end="1:36.440">乱</span><span begin="1:36.440" end="1:36.700">な</span><span begin="1:36.700" end="1:36.850">試</span><span begin="1:36.950" end="1:37.270">供</span><span begin="1:37.270" end="1:37.510">品</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">胡乱可疑的试用品</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">胡亂可疑的試用品</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A dubious trial sample</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">수상쩍은 견본품</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un échantillon suspect</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una sospechosa muestra de prueba</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine dubiose Kostprobe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma amostra de procedência duvidosa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Подозрительный пробный образец</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un campione gratuito sospetto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Uron na shikyouhin</span></p><p begin="1:37.620" end="1:39.930" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.620" end="1:38.110">嘘</span><span begin="1:38.110" end="1:38.240">で</span><span begin="1:38.240" end="1:38.420">は</span><span begin="1:38.570" end="1:38.760">な</span><span begin="1:38.760" end="1:39.020">い</span><span begin="1:39.020" end="1:39.300">の</span><span begin="1:39.400" end="1:39.930">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这并不是谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這並不是謊言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s not a lie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거짓말은 아니야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce n’est pas un mensonge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No es mentira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es ist keine Lüge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não é mentira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это не ложь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non è una bugia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Uso dewa nai no sa</span></p><p begin="1:46.730" end="1:50.110" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.730" end="1:46.970">教</span><span begin="1:46.970" end="1:47.160">え</span><span begin="1:47.330" end="1:47.480">て</span><span begin="1:47.580" end="1:47.840">く</span><span begin="1:47.840" end="1:48.140">れ</span><span begin="1:48.140" end="1:48.320">る</span><span begin="1:48.490" end="1:48.740">ハー</span><span begin="1:48.950" end="1:49.180">ト</span><span begin="1:49.180" end="1:49.390">を</span><span begin="1:49.390" end="1:49.500">あ</span><span begin="1:49.590" end="1:49.960">げ</span><span begin="1:49.960" end="1:50.110">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给你一颗坦诚相告的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">給你一顆坦誠相告的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;ll give you a heart that tells you the answer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">알려 주는 하트를 네게 줄게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je te donnerai un cœur qui saura te l’apprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te daré un corazón que te enseñará</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich schenke dir ein Herz das es dir verrät</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou lhe dar um coração que mostrará a resposta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я подарю тебе сердце которое всё расскажет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti darò un cuore che saprà insegnarti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Oshiete kureru haato o ageru</span></p><p begin="1:50.310" end="1:53.950" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.310" end="1:50.420">あ</span><span begin="1:50.550" end="1:50.740">な</span><span begin="1:50.950" end="1:51.170">た</span><span begin="1:51.170" end="1:51.290">が</span><span begin="1:51.290" end="1:51.600">笑</span><span begin="1:51.600" end="1:51.780">え</span><span begin="1:51.780" end="1:51.890">ば</span><span begin="1:52.100" end="1:52.350">開</span><span begin="1:52.520" end="1:53.020">戦</span><span begin="1:53.020" end="1:53.220">の</span><span begin="1:53.220" end="1:53.660">合</span><span begin="1:53.660" end="1:53.950">図</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你若一笑 便是开战的信号</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你若一笑 便是開戰的信號</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you laugh that&apos;s the signal for war</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 웃으면 개전의 신호</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand tu souris c’est le signal du début de la guerre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si sonríes será la señal para comenzar la guerra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du lachst ist das das Signal zum Krieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando você sorri é o sinal para começar a guerra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Стоит тебе улыбнуться и это знак к началу войны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se sorridi è il segnale d’inizio della guerra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Anata ga waraeba kaisen no aizu</span></p><p begin="1:54.000" end="1:57.310" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.000" end="1:54.810">面</span><span begin="1:54.810" end="1:55.040">上</span><span begin="1:55.040" end="1:55.370">げ</span><span begin="1:55.370" end="1:55.510">て</span><span begin="1:55.510" end="1:55.540">、</span><span begin="1:55.710" end="1:55.930">両</span><span begin="1:56.160" end="1:56.380">眼</span><span begin="1:56.380" end="1:56.580">を</span><span begin="1:56.580" end="1:57.030">開</span><span begin="1:57.030" end="1:57.170">い</span><span begin="1:57.170" end="1:57.310">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抬起头，睁开双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">抬起頭，睜開雙眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lift your head open both your eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고개를 들고 두 눈을 떠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Relève la tête ouvre grand les deux yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Alza el rostro abre bien los ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Heb den Kopf und öffne beide Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Erga o rosto abra bem os olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Подними голову открой оба глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Alza il viso e apri entrambi gli occhi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omote agete, ryoume o hiraite</span></p><p begin="1:57.500" end="2:01.210" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.500" end="1:57.910">次</span><span begin="1:58.170" end="1:58.360">の</span><span begin="1:58.360" end="1:58.530">世</span><span begin="1:58.630" end="1:59.010">界</span><span begin="1:59.010" end="1:59.130">へ</span><span begin="1:59.130" end="1:59.160">、</span><span begin="1:59.360" end="2:00.220">誘</span><span begin="2:00.220" end="2:00.410">う</span><span begin="2:00.410" end="2:00.870">前</span><span begin="2:00.870" end="2:01.210">夜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">通往新世界，诱引的前夜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">通往新世界，誘引的前夜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">On the eve that beckons us to the next world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다음 세계로 이끄는 전야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Vers le monde suivant la veille de l’invitation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La víspera que invita al próximo mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Nacht bevor ich dich in die nächste Welt entführe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A véspera que nos convida ao próximo mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">К следующему миру в ночь перед приглашением</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La vigilia che invita verso il prossimo mondo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsugi no sekai e, izanau zen&apos;ya</span></p><p begin="2:01.330" end="2:02.730" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.330" end="2:01.800">波</span><span begin="2:01.800" end="2:02.020">の</span><span begin="2:02.020" end="2:02.270">ま</span><span begin="2:02.270" end="2:02.480">に</span><span begin="2:02.480" end="2:02.600">ま</span><span begin="2:02.600" end="2:02.730">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随波逐流</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">隨波逐流</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">At the mercy of the waves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">파도에 몸을 맡긴 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au gré des vagues</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A merced de las olas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ganz wie die Wellen es wollen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ao sabor das ondas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Плывя по воле волн</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasciandoci portare dalle onde</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nami no manimani</span></p><p begin="2:02.920" end="2:05.100" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.920" end="2:03.380">甘</span><span begin="2:03.380" end="2:03.590">美</span><span begin="2:03.590" end="2:03.820">な</span><span begin="2:03.820" end="2:04.040">魔</span><span begin="2:04.040" end="2:04.280">法</span><span begin="2:04.280" end="2:04.410">み</span><span begin="2:04.410" end="2:04.620">た</span><span begin="2:04.620" end="2:04.770">い</span><span begin="2:04.770" end="2:05.100">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如甘美的魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">宛如甘美的魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like luscious magic</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">감미로운 마법처럼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme une délicieuse magie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como una magia dulcemente irresistible</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie ein süßer Zauber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como uma magia deliciosamente doce</