gin="2:15.580" end="2:19.420">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别厌恶啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請別厭惡啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t turn away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">싫어하지 말아 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne me déteste pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No me rechaces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verabscheu mich nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não rejeite isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не отвергай меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non disdegnarmi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itowanaide yo</span></p><p begin="2:20.760" end="2:26.660" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.760" end="2:21.650">厭</span><span begin="2:21.650" end="2:21.800">わ</span><span begin="2:21.900" end="2:22.220">な</span><span begin="2:22.220" end="2:22.340">い</span><span begin="2:22.340" end="2:22.810">で</span><span begin="2:22.810" end="2:26.660">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别厌恶啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請別厭惡啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t turn away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">싫어하지 말아 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne me déteste pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No me rechaces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verabscheu mich nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não rejeite isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не отвергай меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non disdegnarmi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itowanaide yo</span></p><p begin="2:27.910" end="2:31.440" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.910" end="2:29.330">許</span><span begin="2:29.330" end="2:30.080">し</span><span begin="2:30.210" end="2:31.440">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原谅我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">原諒我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Forgive me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">용서해 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pardonne-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Perdóname</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vergib mir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perdoe-me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прости меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perdonami</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yurushite</span></p><p begin="2:41.970" end="2:52.200" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.970" end="2:43.060">あぁ</span><span begin="2:44.040" end="2:44.480">何</span><span begin="2:44.480" end="2:44.720">も</span><span begin="2:44.810" end="2:45.310">か</span><span begin="2:45.530" end="2:46.180">も</span><span begin="2:46.950" end="2:47.170">真</span><span begin="2:47.170" end="2:47.440">夜</span><span begin="2:47.440" end="2:48.310">中</span><span begin="2:48.430" end="2:49.300">に</span><span begin="2:50.060" end="2:50.860">な</span><span begin="2:50.860" end="2:52.200">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 一切都将化作深更半夜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊啊 一切都將化作深更半夜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah everything turns into midnight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 모든 것이 한밤중이 되어 가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah tout finit par devenir minuit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah todo acaba convirtiéndose en medianoche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah alles wird zu tiefster Mitternacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah tudo acaba virando meia-noite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах всё превращается в полночь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah ogni cosa diventa mezzanotte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa nanimokamo mayonaka ni naru</span></p><p begin="2:53.990" end="2:57.070" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.990" end="2:54.440">不</span><span begin="2:54.440" end="2:54.790">安</span><span begin="2:54.790" end="2:55.200">系</span><span begin="2:55.200" end="2:55.580">な</span><span begin="2:55.580" end="2:55.810">あ</span><span begin="2:55.810" end="2:56.040">な</span><span begin="2:56.040" end="2:56.240">た</span><span begin="2:56.240" end="2:56.490">た</span><span begin="2:56.490" end="2:56.610">ち</span><span begin="2:56.610" end="2:57.070">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给心怀不安的你们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">給心懷不安的你們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To all you anxious souls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">불안한 너희에게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À vous les âmes rongées par l’inquiétude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A ustedes hechos de ansiedad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Euch von der ängstlichen Sorte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A vocês consumidos pela inquietação</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вам тревожным</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">A voi così pieni d’ansia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Fuankei na anatatachi ni</span></p><p begin="2:57.580" end="3:00.600" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.580" end="2:58.040">得</span><span begin="2:58.040" end="2:58.260">ら</span><span begin="2:58.260" end="2:58.390">れ</span><span begin="2:58.390" end="2:58.560">な</span><span begin="2:58.560" end="2:58.700">い</span><span begin="2:58.700" end="2:59.060">ケー</span><span begin="2:59.150" end="2:59.390">キ</span><span begin="2:59.390" end="2:59.630">を</span><span begin="2:59.630" end="2:59.890">振</span><span begin="2:59.890" end="3:00.100">る</span><span begin="3:00.100" end="3:00.280">舞</span><span begin="3:00.280" end="3:00.600">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">款待那无法得手的蛋糕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">款待那無法得手的蛋糕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;ll serve you a cake you can never have</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가질 수 없는 케이크를 대접할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je servirai un gâteau que vous ne pourrez jamais obtenir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Les serviré un pastel que jamás podrán conseguir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Serviere ich einen Kuchen den ihr niemals bekommen könnt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sirvo um bolo que jamais poderão obter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я подам пирог которого вам никогда не получить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Servirò una torta che non potrete mai avere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Erarenai keeki o furumau</span></p><p begin="3:01.190" end="3:04.270" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.190" end="3:01.660">ロ</span><span begin="3:01.660" end="3:01.880">マ</span><span begin="3:01.880" end="3:01.970">ン</span><span begin="3:01.970" end="3:02.160">チ</span><span begin="3:02.160" end="3:02.190">ッ</span><span begin="3:02.190" end="3:02.230">ク</span><span begin="3:02.320" end="3:02.680">シ</span><span begin="3:02.680" end="3:02.770">ッ</span><span begin="3:02.770" end="3:03.030">ク</span><span begin="3:03.030" end="3:03.240">な</span><span begin="3:03.240" end="3:03.820">形</span><span begin="3:03.820" end="3:04.270">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以浪漫病态的形状</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">以浪漫病態的形狀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Molded into a romantic-chic shape</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">로맨틱 시크한 형태로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sous une forme romantique et maladive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con una forma románticamente enfermiza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In romantisch-kranker Gestalt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Moldado numa forma romanticamente doentia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В романтично-болезненной форме</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In una forma romanticamente malata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Romanchikku shikku na katachi ni</span></p><p begin="3:04.800" end="3:07.920" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.800" end="3:05.240">模</span><span begin="3:05.240" end="3:05.530">造</span><span begin="3:05.530" end="3:05.630">し</span><span begin="3:05.630" end="3:05.950">た</span><span begin="3:05.950" end="3:06.370">刑</span><span begin="3:06.370" end="3:06.620">期</span><span begin="3:06.620" end="3:06.860">が</span><span begin="3:06.860" end="3:07.100">終</span><span begin="3:07.100" end="3:07.310">わ</span><span begin="3:07.310" end="3:07.430">れ</span><span begin="3:07.430" end="3:07.920">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待这伪造的刑期结束</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">待這偽造的刑期結束</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When this imitation prison term is over</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모조한 형기가 끝나면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand prendra fin cette peine contrefaite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando termine la condena que hemos falsificado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn die künstliche Haftzeit endlich vorbei ist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando terminar a pena que imitamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда закончится поддельный срок наказания</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando finirà la pena che abbiamo contraffatto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mozou shita keiki ga owareba</span></p><p begin="3:08.360" end="3:11.500" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.360" end="3:08.660">間</span><span begin="3:08.660" end="3:09.100">違</span><span begin="3:09.100" end="3:09.220">い</span><span begin="3:09.220" end="3:09.400">だ</span><span begin="3:09.570" end="3:09.990">ら</span><span begin="3:09.990" end="3:10.250">け</span><span begin="3:10.250" end="3:10.460">の</span><span begin="3:10.460" end="3:10.920">僕</span><span begin="3:10.920" end="3:11.050">ら</span><span begin="3:11.050" end="3:11.500">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给错漏百出的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">給錯漏百出的我們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To us who get everything wrong</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">온통 틀린 것투성이인 우리에게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour nous qui ne faisons que nous tromper</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A nosotros llenos de errores</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir die voller Fehler sind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para nós tão cheios de erros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нам таким полным ошибок</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per noi pieni di errori</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Machigai darake no bokura ni</span></p><p begin="3:12.030" end="3:15.200" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.030" end="3:12.360">も</span><span begin="3:12.360" end="3:12.440">う</span><span begin="3:12.440" end="3:12.800">半</span><span begin="3:12.800" end="3:13.160">信</span><span begin="3:13.160" end="3:13.620">半</span><span begin="3:13.620" end="3:13.840">疑</span><span begin="3:13.840" end="3:14.070">は</span><span begin="3:14.070" end="3:14.300">い</span><span begin="3:14.300" end="3:14.530">ら</span><span begin="3:14.530" end="3:14.660">な</span><span begin="3:14.660" end="3:15.200">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再需要半信半疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不再需要半信半疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">No more wavering between belief and doubt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이젠 반신반의 따윈 필요 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Plus besoin de douter à moitié</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no nos hace falta seguir dudando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Brauchen dieses ewige Zweifeln nicht mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Já não precisamos de meias certezas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Больше не нужны сомнения</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non serve più essere in dubbio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mou hanshinhangi wa iranai</span></p><p begin="3:15.600" end="3:17.650" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.600" end="3:15.860">そ</span><span begin="3:15.860" end="3:15.980">う</span><span begin="3:16.060" end="3:16.330">勘</span><span begin="3:16.330" end="3:16.620">違</span><span begin="3:16.620" end="3:16.690">い</span><span begin="3:16.690" end="3:16.800">し</span><span begin="3:16.800" end="3:17.130">た</span><span begin="3:17.130" end="3:17.210">い</span><span begin="3:17.210" end="3:17.400">の</span><span begin="3:17.400" end="3:17.650">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我便是想这般误解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我便是想這般誤解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That&apos;s what I want to fool myself into believing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래 그렇게 착각하고 싶은 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oui j’ai envie de me tromper ainsi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sí quiero engañarme creyendo eso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ja genau so will ich mich irren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É isso que eu quero acreditar por engano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Да я хочу продолжать так заблуждаться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sì voglio illudermi proprio così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sou kanchigai shitai no sa</span></p><p begin="3:17.650" end="3:19.600" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.650" end="3:18.100">痛</span><span begin="3:18.100" end="3:18.150">い</span><span begin="3:18.150" end="3:18.290">の</span><span begin="3:18.290" end="3:18.760">に</span><span begin="3:19.250" end="3:19.600">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕伴随痛楚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕伴隨痛楚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even though it hurts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아픈데도 말이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si ça fait mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque duela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Obwohl es wehtut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que doa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хоть это и больно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se fa male</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itai noni to</span></p><p begin="3:19.690" end="3:22.760" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:19.690" end="3:20.010">単</span><span begin="3:20.010" end="3:20.380">身</span><span begin="3:20.380" end="3:20.840">装</span><span begin="3:20.840" end="3:21.030">備</span><span begin="3:21.030" end="3:21.070">じ</span><span begin="3:21.070" end="3:21.300">ゃ</span><span begin="3:21.300" end="3:21.530">足</span><span begin="3:21.530" end="3:21.740">り</span><span begin="3:21.740" end="3:21.920">な</span><span begin="3:21.920" end="3:22.760">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">单枪匹马装备不足</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">單槍匹馬裝備不足</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Going in alone isn&apos;t enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">혼자만의 장비로는 부족해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un équipement en solitaire ne suffit pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ir sola con este equipo no basta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Allein ausgerüstet reicht es nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Estar equipada sozinha não basta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одной экипировки недостаточно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un equipaggiamento da solista non basta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tanshin soubi ja tarinai</span></p><p begin="3:23.300" end="3:24.780" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:23.300" end="3:23.710">愛</span><span begin="3:23.710" end="3:23.940">は</span><span begin="3:23.940" end="3:24.190">非</span><span begin="3:24.190" end="3:24.550">常</span><span begin="3:24.550" end="3:24.780">勤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱是非常勤的职员</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">愛是非常勤的職員</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Love is only part-time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑은 비상근</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L’amour n’est là qu’à temps partiel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El amor trabaja a media jornada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Liebe arbeitet nur in Teilzeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O amor trabalha só meio período</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Любовь работает по совместительству</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L’amore lavora solo part time</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ai wa hijoukin</span></p><p begin="3:24.830" end="3:26.620" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.830" end="3:25.120">そ</span><span begin="3:25.120" end="3:25.340">れ</span><span begin="3:25.340" end="3:25.450">す</span><span begin="3:25.450" end="3:25.760">ら</span><span begin="3:25.760" end="3:26.160">愛</span><span begin="3:26.160" end="3:26.310">お</span><span begin="3:26.310" end="3:26.510">し</span><span begin="3:26.510" end="3:26.620">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连这也令人怜惜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連這也令人憐惜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even that is dear to me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그것마저 사랑스러워</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et même cela m’est précieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y hasta eso me resulta entrañable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und selbst das ist mir lieb</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E até isso me é precioso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И даже это мне дорого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E perfino questo mi è caro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore sura itooshii</span></p><p begin="3:26.690" end="3:30.020" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.690" end="3:27.120">今</span><span begin="3:27.120" end="3:27.580">更</span><span begin="3:27.580" end="3:28.030">迎</span><span begin="3:28.030" end="3:28.220">え</span><span begin="3:28.220" end="3:28.490">に</span><span begin="3:28.490" end="3:28.650">行</span><span begin="3:28.730" end="3:28.980">く</span><span begin="3:29.060" end="3:29.420">か</span><span begin="3:29.420" end="3:29.560">ら</span><span begin="3:29.660" end="3:30.020">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今才去迎接你呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">事到如今才去迎接你呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;ll come for you now even if it&apos;s late</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이제 와서라도 데리러 갈 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il est bien tard mais je viens te chercher</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque sea tarde iré a buscarte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt komme ich dich doch noch holen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo agora vou buscar você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Теперь уже поздно но я всё равно приду за тобой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ormai verrò a prenderti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Imasara mukae ni yuku kara ne</span></p><p begin="3:30.550" end="3:32.060" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.550" end="3:30.900">後</span><span begin="3:30.900" end="3:31.180">悔</span><span begin="3:31.180" end="3:31.240">を</span><span begin="3:31.240" end="3:31.460">疑</span><span begin="3:31.460" end="3:31.740">問</span><span begin="3:31.740" end="3:32.060">視</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对后悔表示质疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">對後悔表示質疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Questioning regret</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">후회를 의심하고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mettre le regret en doute</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pongo en duda el arrepentimiento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich stelle die Reue infrage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ponho o arrependimento em dúvida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сомневаюсь даже в сожалениях</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Metto in dubbio il rimpianto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Koukai o gimonshi</span></p><p begin="3:32.110" end="3:33.850" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.110" end="3:32.270">胡</span><span begin="3:32.360" end="3:32.710">乱</span><span begin="3:32.710" end="3:32.960">な</span><span begin="3:32.960" end="3:33.150">試</span><span begin="3:33.240" end="3:33.570">供</span><span begin="3:33.570" end="3:33.850">品</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">胡乱可疑的试用品</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">胡亂可疑的試用品</span><span ttm:role="x-translati